lg:RO-LCE-art5-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "92503f7746eecb843e7dab85582ab96d2866c34e083ac3bc49753df2fbd9b24f" ;
    lgo:text """(1) The service provider is obliged to make available to recipients and public authorities means allowing easy, direct, permanent and free access to at least the following information:
a) the name or denomination of the service provider;
b) the domicile or seat of the service provider;
c) the telephone and fax numbers, the email address and any other data necessary for contacting the service provider directly and effectively;
d) the registration number or other similar means of identification, where the service provider is entered in the trade register or in another similar public register;
e) the tax registration code;
f) the identification data of the competent authority, where the activity of the service provider is subject to an authorisation regime;
g) the professional title and the state in which it was awarded, the professional body or any other similar body of which the provider is a member, an indication of the rules applicable to the profession in the state where the service provider is established, as well as the means of access to them, where the service provider carries on a regulated professional activity;
h) the tariffs for the services offered, which must be indicated in compliance with the rules on the marketing of products and services, specifying whether VAT is exempted, included or not included, and its amount;
i) the inclusion or non-inclusion of delivery costs in the price, as well as their amount, where applicable;
j) any other information which the service provider is obliged to make available to recipients, in accordance with the laws in force."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-15"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:RO-LCE-art5-1-q1 .

lg:RO-LCE-art5-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "ffcad67c3a8358c2a4777959013f60d2e921b119f061ccc975571b504ab2f68a" ;
    lgo:text "(2) The obligation under paragraph (1) is deemed fulfilled where a service provider displays this information in a clear, visible and permanent form inside the web page through which the service is offered, under the conditions mentioned in paragraph (1)."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-15"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:RO-LCE-art5-2-q1 .

lg:RO-LCE-art5-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "81483cf16be307d1a3e6639c6495a35a67845d4ee402724d4ef884505821f2e5" ;
    lgo:text "(3) The service provider is obliged to ensure that the information made available under paragraph (1) is kept up to date and can be used by public authorities for receiving any communications under the law."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-15"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:RO-LCE-art5-3-q1 .

lg:RO-LCE-title-3da1099a81bd-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "3da1099a81bdcdad0edf5b46a5a4f52a109eeca137447f76f73ee6b5537ea7a5" ;
    lgo:text "Law no. 365 of 7 June 2002 on electronic commerce"@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translatedProperty eli:title ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
